                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It appears no one in the world has bought this game, except me.\nBUT I am unable to play it because it's an ONLINE MULTIPLAYER experience but there is ZERO players.\nThere is NO AI, no option to fight anything.\nAll I can do is fly around on empty levels and murder goats.\nThis game might have been fun if it was active but even then the 10€ price-tag is brutally overpriced.\n\nThe game is not playable in it's current state and I unfortunately doubt it will ever be. \nThe idea was great but the execution is not.",
